  "analysis_md": "因为$u_x=z\\cdot\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{z-1}=\\frac{z}{y}\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{z-1},\\quad u_y=z\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{x}{y^2}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{z-1}=-\\frac{xz}{y^2}\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{z-1},\\quad u_z=\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^z\\ln\\frac{x}{y},\\quad 所以$\n\n$\\left.du\\right|_{(1,2,3)}=\\frac{3}{8}dx-\\frac{3}{16}dy-\\frac{1}{8}\\ln2\\,dz.$",
